  "transcript": "Sleep is cruel\nwhen pain is near.\nWhen gripped by fear,\nlet darkness rule.\n\nIn dreams of light,\na gilded fraud,\nwe drift in awe\nwithout our sight.\n\nWe wake in dread.\nWe ache inside.\nWe cannot hide.\nWe stare ahead.\n\nThen we recall\nthe lawless fact:\nit will not slack,\nit will not pause \u2014\n\nuntil we sleep.\nIt starts again\nthe moment when\nwe take the leap.",
